  <p id="c-sanguozhi-049-appraisal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　評曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-appraisal:p001:m0005" ref="fvd_gis_x74">劉繇</persName>藻厲名行，好尚臧否。至於擾攘之時，據萬里之士，非其長也。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-appraisal:p001:m0035" ref="s52_ysc_gyl">太史慈</persName>信義篤烈，有古人之分。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-049-appraisal:p001:m0049" ref="p2p_gqb_6ar">士燮</persName>作守南越，優遊終世，至子不慎，自貽兇咎。蓋庸才玩富貴而恃阻險，使之然也。</p>
</text>
